WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:02.755
Match setup: the match info, both teams, then the coin toss.

2
00:00:02.805 --> 00:00:05.386
Official match: "Load match from schedule" fills it in.

3
00:00:05.436 --> 00:00:12.436
"Edit": date, hall, referees, scorer, line judges and the match format.

4
00:00:14.425 --> 00:00:16.731
"Edit roster": players, liberos, captain and bench officials.

5
00:00:16.781 --> 00:00:23.781
A new player: number, name, date of birth, then "Add".

6
00:00:26.430 --> 00:00:29.818
The libero column marks L1 and L2, "C" marks the captain.

7
00:00:29.868 --> 00:00:36.124
Coaches can send their own roster: "Remote" shows the Upload PIN.

8
00:00:36.174 --> 00:00:39.451
Below the players: the bench officials.

9
00:00:39.501 --> 00:00:41.734
"Confirm" saves the roster.

10
00:00:41.784 --> 00:00:46.423
Tap a shirt to change the team colour.

11
00:00:46.473 --> 00:00:50.456
All set: "Coin toss".
